{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f5844c1b4448279a4fa5e6db3f8a96e7ae0b3728f7ff1cd619541158630c74a", "ja": "（バラエティ系スポーツ番組で優勝したあずささん。\nその後、同系番組からオファーが相次いでいるが……）", "zh": "（在综艺类体育节目中获胜的亚子小姐。之后，同类型节目接连发来邀约，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "c19c88078fa1a931186635d7ec2b977af5c343ef42c367768526b89542fe0bbe", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……あ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0564a9ea3545a99721658eaef0256b965321bf15ecb12872bdf9615bef9e9d9", "ja": "あずささん？　どうしたんですか、こんなところで……\nひょっとしてトレーニングを？", "zh": "あずさ小姐？您怎么会在这种地方……\n难道是在训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "bf3ba6ec2e4909428b1673d6069c9b562e0468ead93949e82207d915dab667b2", "ja": "はい、ちょっと体力づくりをしようと思って。\n劇場のまわりを、軽く走っていたんです……はぁ。", "zh": "是的，我想着稍微锻炼一下体力。\n刚才在剧场周围慢跑了一会儿……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "3a3c05e1436ac78cf0adefcbe0831b18ff3bff0cd2ced98c8c745de112272562", "ja": "最近、運動系のお仕事が増えてきましたし……\nはぁ、そのための、自主レッスンみたいなものです。", "zh": "最近运动类的工作越来越多了……\n呼，这算是为此做的自主练习之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1005_p", "source_sha256": "66b9ee0085ca414d0fec0deda64dbd6924fd7e7e95a8b888fc0e053be04bd782", "ja": "『アイドルセクシーパーク』、大反響でしたからね。\nおかげで似た感じのオファーが増えているところです。", "zh": "因为《偶像性感乐园》的反响非常热烈呢。\n托它的福，类似感觉的通告也在不断增加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "28421bb2995ef9d844b157b200e46694e0f506ccedf96aa20b4b8815dcb0e8ff", "ja": "とってもありがたいですよね。それならなおさら、\nちゃんと準備しておかないと……！", "zh": "真的非常感谢呢。既然这样，就更要好好准备才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "5ef059139bb1f944dcd443d7b0dd52e7f2c6cd274cad49e483076c847025665d", "ja": "本当は、運動は得意ではないので……。みっともない\nところをお見せしたくないですからね。", "zh": "其实，我并不擅长运动……因为不想让您看到我笨拙的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1008_p", "source_sha256": "791bdf0c35ccc5bd39a3fd0c41bc9ef0b12ef2aa6f049fbd91645e0b27344491", "ja": "なるほど。でも、無理はしないでください。\n辛そうですし……スケジュールも調整しましょう！", "zh": "原来如此。不过，请不要勉强自己。看起来挺辛苦的……我们也调整一下日程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "f5af1fcf2d58491959514441ba5c1fc3cc1db150cb60bd0a4a58055df971ff24", "ja": "あっ、いえ、大丈夫ですよ！\nむしろ、楽しんでいますから♪", "zh": "啊，不，没关系的！\n倒不如说，我还挺享受的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0ca3201f0d7be5788be49d5fe0402bad3ebc0e6ff12564cecc8555d9f4e3872b", "ja": "楽しんでいる、ですか？", "zh": "你说你在享受？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "9ded0a6b92b08113a39e8141b7b9537c8c66d56fd513260af58924707c4b3d6c", "ja": "はい。結果を残せたことで、\n苦手意識がぐっと薄くなったみたいで。", "zh": "是的。因为取得了成果，好像对它的畏惧感一下子减轻了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "7d8d65c970c8152a91a53350a28ee96e4ff6634eff96c33fba9d8fc4c8876cae", "ja": "もちろん、あの番組で勝てたのは、バラエティ要素も多\nかったからだと思いますけど……それでも嬉しくって。", "zh": "当然，我觉得能在那个节目里获胜，也是因为\n综艺要素比较多就是了……不过即便如此，我还是很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8367d83a2f4744a608764bd19eec1b6655cf783a0564d46478d49c64ef04b826", "ja": "あずささんが実力でつかんだ立派な優勝ですよ。\nでも、無理してるんじゃないならよかったです。", "zh": "那可是梓小姐凭实力赢得的漂亮冠军。\n不过，只要不是在勉强自己，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "254331ed8206802f77705c378aca5397e66c5a7115b351aac11c8b1b79b7af76", "ja": "ありがとうございます、とっても楽しいです♪", "zh": "谢谢您，我感到非常开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "96319b9bc72143b11f7b66d75abf038c8f6eaa885dd3626adfb315b4505e6a4a", "ja": "これからも、優勝とまでは行かなくても、\n精いっぱい努力して、きちんと結果も出せて……。", "zh": "今后就算还不能夺冠，我也会竭尽全力努力，拿出切实的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "573f2383336e9a7f5c6fc6e2a9ca6848a55155d47fbe09ac12aa5e1f89b84e2b", "ja": "「頑張って良かった」って思えたら、嬉しいなって。\n{$P$}さん。期待しててくださいね♪", "zh": "要是能觉得“努力过了真好”，我就会很高兴呢。\n{$P$}先生。请好好期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0553_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a6e16fcd6fce115485aaa16f446fb95c79d592cd21636a38a40f7a5e2019d135", "ja": "（達成感が自信につながったんだな。あずささんの\n前向きな努力、なんとしても次につなげなきゃな！）", "zh": "（原来成就感让她变得更有自信了。一定要想办法让静香小姐积极向上的努力延续到下一步才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
